{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022132002978-1022_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261022132002\"/><p>教宗罹患肺腺癌。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>天主教教宗良十四世日前確步肺腺癌，已接受切除手術。梵蒂岡周三（21日）公布樣本組織病理學檢查和分析結果，確認是肺腺癌，並未擴散。根據後續的腫瘤評估，確認不需要任何進一步的治療。</p><p>教宗當天在聖伯多祿廣場主持例行的公開接見活動，歷時50分鐘，教宗感謝大眾的支持與祈禱。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:41:13.715777+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:20:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T10:58:04.883733+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:37:39.349556+00:00","content_hash":"dea60a072cc3e74f5f26d2698a20d9e8edd36f89695fd5ff4bc66ccabdd883e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}